title: "Signal Feed: X and YouTube feeds, minus the bait"
abstract: "A Chrome extension that folds ragebait, empty hype and engagement bait in the X and YouTube feeds, each with the reason why, using a fast judgment model through the user's own OpenRouter key; with an open evaluation set."
